      "message": "not `google-*`?\n\nof all the google- stuff i found in the clang docs, only https://clang.llvm.org/extra/clang-tidy/checks/google-explicit-constructor.html and https://clang.llvm.org/extra/clang-tidy/checks/google-readability-casting.html seemed like ones whose signal-to-noise ratio we\u0027d be at all likely to defend as part of the default set?",
